  "//overrides": "Build-tooling transitives with no direct dependent to bump — every dependent range still resolves to a vulnerable patch. All reach us only through vite/vitest/jsdom/eslint, none ship in the browser bundle. brace-expansion 5.0.9 is a deliberate cross-major force on eslint's 1.x copies — verified against eslint, tsc, 439 tests and the production build. Unlike cdk's, every copy here is reachable by this override, so none needs suppressing.",
